{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04161","headline":"晚憩田家 · 骆宾王","name":"晚憩田家","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"转蓬劳远役，披薜下田家。\n山形类九折，水势急三巴。\n悬梁接断岸，涩路拥崩查。\n雾岩沦晓魄，风漵涨寒沙。\n心迹一朝舛，关山万里赊。\n龙章徒表越，闽俗本殊华。\n旅行悲泛梗，离赠折疎麻。\n唯有寒潭菊，独似故园花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04161.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04161","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}